{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45089","headline":"自义亭驿送李长史纵夜泊临平东湖 · 皎然","name":"自义亭驿送李长史纵夜泊临平东湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长亭宾驭散，岐路起悲风。\n千里勤王事，驱车明月中。\n寒生洞庭水，夜度塞门鸿。\n处处堪伤别，归来山又空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}